        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "jeannie.chan@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "Michelle.Covello@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Aug 18 2017 09:40:58 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<p>At the heart of Stryker’s Emerging Professionals is the desire to come alongside emerging professionals and offer a helping hand so that they can thrive in Stryker’s culture and reach their full potential. Our mission is to engage, support, and inspire the next generation of Stryker professionals. </p>\n<p>SEP is committed to their members by offering avenues for emerging professionals to network and create forums for senior-level employees to provide wisdom to the next generation. There are also opportunities to inspire the surrounding community by volunteering at schools and participating in our recruiting events.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Nov 16 2017 13:50:52 GMT-0500",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
